      "title": "Find the assembled path",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "The orders router declares local /orders. Including it with prefix /api assembles the operation at /api/orders. Tags, dependencies and responses can also be supplied at the include point.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "fastapi.modular_application"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "fastapi.modular_application#f2",
              "fastapi.modular_application#f3"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "fastapi.modular_application#tb4",
              "fastapi.modular_application#tb5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "A feature module’s presence is not application assembly. Trace registration on the router and then app.include_router: defining a router alone does not include its operations.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "fastapi.modular_application"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "fastapi.modular_application#f1",
              "fastapi.modular_application#f2"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "fastapi.modular_application#tb4",
              "fastapi.modular_application#tb5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
